<title>USA: Broker raises SBE stake, may seek seat.</title>
<headline>Broker raises SBE stake, may seek seat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steven Newby, a Rockville, Md. broker-dealer, said Tuesday he raised his stake in SBE Inc to 8.33 percent or 172,750 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Newby said he bought 45,000 additional shares of SBE on August 29 at $5.125 to $5.25 a share.</p>
<p>Newby said he holds the stake for investment purposes and that he may seek a position in the SBE board of directors.</p>
<p>SBE closed Tuesday at 4-3/4, off 1/2.</p>
</text>
